To validate payment details using the Luhn algorithm, you could create a separate utility function:

```java
public boolean isValidCreditCardNumber(String creditCardNumber) {
    int sum = 0;
    for (int i = creditCardNumber.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        int digit = Character.getNumericValue(creditCardNumber.charAt(i));
        if ((i % 2 == 0) && (digit * 2 > 9)) {
            sum += digit * 2 + 9;
        } else {
            sum += digit;
        }
    }
    return sum % 10 == 0;
}
