For retry mechanism, you could use a utility function that attempts to process the payment up to 5 times with exponential backoff before giving up and returning an error message:

```java
public boolean processPaymentWithRetries(Payment payment) {
    int retryCount = 0;
    while (retryCount < 5) {
        try {
            // process the payment
            return true;
        } catch (TransientNetworkError e) {
            // exponential backoff
            retryCount++;
            if (retryCount == 5) {
                return false; // give up after 5 retries
            }
            Thread.sleep(2 * (int) Math.pow(2, retryCount - 1));
        }
    }
}
